  "keyFeatures": [
    "AI character chat with customizable personalities, backstories, and interaction styles",
    "Support for multiple LLM providers: OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Doubao, Volink, and custom OpenAI-compatible APIs",
    "Character card import from external platforms (Chub.ai, Janitor.ai, AI Character Cards, Pygmalion, RealmRisu)",
    "Lorebook (World Book) for maintaining world-building and story consistency",
    "Presets for configuring AI prompt templates and behavior",
    "Regex scripts for automatic text processing and transformation",
    "Long-term memory across conversations",
    "Group chat with multiple AI characters",
    "Voice synthesis with ElevenLabs, Google TTS, Gemini, Volink, and local TTS",
    "Advanced HTML/CSS rendering and JavaScript API for custom interactivity",
    "Macro system for dynamic prompt injection and variable management",
    "Persona system for defining user identity in roleplay"
  ],
